   |
 4 | .Synchronized
   | ------------- this method runs under its instance's guard
...
10 |         changed.emit(balance);
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the event is emitted here
   |
   = help: commit the change, leave the guard, then emit

